  {
   "approach": "From Longs Peak Trailhead on Highway 7, take the Longs Peak Trail toward Chasm Lake; the ice is a short walk off the trail to the lake, in the Columbine Falls and Peacock Pool area. It has a steep start for a short way, then a low-angle slab.",
