   "approach": "Start at the Longs Peak Trailhead, on Highway 7, and follow the Longs Peak Trail to the Chasm Lake Trail; the lake is about 4.2 miles and 2,400 ft of gain from the trailhead. The route is a single pitch on the West Tower of Ship's Prow, on the shore of Chasm Lake. Start about 40 ft to the left and higher than where Mizzenmast and Feel the Stern share their opening pitch.",
