  {
   "approach": "Start at the Longs Peak Trailhead, on Highway 7, and follow the Longs Peak Trail to the Chasm Lake Trail; the lake is about 4.2 miles and 2,400 ft of gain from the trailhead. Skirt Chasm Lake on its north side (in winter the frozen lake can be crossed) to reach Mills Glacier beneath the east face, where Lamb's Slide begins. Climb Lamb's Slide past Zumie's Thumb and go up the gully to its left.",
   "area_id": "co_long_s_peak_mt_meeker_cirque",
   "descent": null,
