   "approach": "Start at the Longs Peak Trailhead, on Highway 7, and follow the Longs Peak Trail to the Chasm Lake Trail; the lake is about 4.2 miles and 2,400 ft of gain from the trailhead. The ice is on the climber's-right side of Ship's Prow, on the left shore of Chasm Lake. The climb starts above a pile of large boulders, with a short scramble of about 15 ft to the base of a corner.",
   "area_id": "co_long_s_peak_mt_meeker_cirque",
