  {
   "approach": "Follow the Longs Peak Trail toward Chasm Lake; the ice is directly above Peacock Pool, at the spot where the Chasm Meadow trail crosses below Mount Lady Washington's south face. It forms fast in cold, cloudy weather and may be gone within hours in sun, as it faces south.",
   "area_id": "co_long_s_peak_mt_meeker_cirque",
   "descent": null,
   "descent_text": "Rappel to the base from a gear anchor above and right of the top pitch.",
